<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Inled Repository</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #0052cc;
            --primary-hover: #0065ff;
            --bg: #f4f7fa;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text: #172b4d;
            --text-muted: #6b778c;
            --code-bg: #f1f2f4;
            --border: #dfe1e6;
        }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--text);
            background-color: var(--bg);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .logo {
            max-width: 250px;
            height: auto;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--primary); }
        .description { font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
        
        .card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            padding: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        h2 { margin-top: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--code-bg); padding-bottom: 10px; }
        h3 { color: var(--primary); margin-top: 25px; }
        
        pre {
            background: var(--code-bg);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            position: relative;
        }
        code { font-family: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, "Liberation Mono", Menlo, monospace; }
        
        .package-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .package-item {
            background: var(--code-bg);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }
        .package-item:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        .package-header {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .package-name { 
            font-weight: bold; 
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--primary);
            display: block; 
        }
        .package-version {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            background: var(--border);
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-top: 4px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .package-desc { 
            font-size: 0.85rem; 
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin: 10px 0;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }
        .package-footer {
            margin-top: 15px;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .btn-sm {
            padding: 6px 12px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
            width: auto;
            flex: 1 1 auto;
            justify-content: center;
            min-width: 80px;
        }

        .btn-deb { background: #d70a53; } /* Debian Red */
        .btn-rpm { background: #3c6eb4; } /* Fedora Blue */
        .btn-arch { background: #1793d1; } /* Arch Blue */
        .btn-deb:hover { background: #a50740; }
        .btn-rpm:hover { background: #2e558a; }
        .btn-arch:hover { background: #1275a7; }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: background 0.2s;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .btn:hover { background: var(--primary-hover); }
        
        .alert {
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .alert-info { background: #deebff; color: #0747a6; border: 1px solid #b3d4ff; }
        .alert-warning { background: #fffae6; color: #826a00; border: 1px solid #fff0b3; }
        
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 60px;
            padding-bottom: 40px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .container { margin: 20px auto; }
            h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
            .package-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <img src="https://hosted.inled.es/inled-logo-full.png" alt="Inled Logo" class="logo">
            <p class="description">Repositorio oficial de paquetes para las aplicaciones de Inled.</p>
        </header>

        <section class="card">
            <h2>📦 Paquetes disponibles</h2>
            <div id="packages-container">
                <ul class="package-list">
                    <!-- PACKAGES_LIST_PLACEHOLDER -->
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
            <h2>🚀 Cómo usar este repositorio</h2>
            
            <h3>Ubuntu / Debian (APT)</h3>
            <pre><code># 1. Descargar la llave GPG
wget -qO- https://apt.inled.es/archive.key | gpg --dearmor | sudo tee /usr/share/keyrings/inled-archive-keyring.gpg > /dev/null

# 2. Añadir el repositorio
echo "deb [signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/inled-archive-keyring.gpg] https://apt.inled.es stable main" | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/inled.list

# 3. Actualizar e instalar
sudo apt update</code></pre>

            <div class="alert alert-warning">
                <strong>¿Problemas con apt update?</strong><br>
                Si recibes errores de "malformed line" o "NOSPLIT", verifica que el archivo <code>/etc/apt/sources.list.d/inled.list</code> contenga una sola línea y que no termine en barra diagonal (/) después de <code>stable main</code>.
            </div>

            <h3>Fedora / RHEL / CentOS (DNF/YUM)</h3>
            <pre><code># Crear el archivo de configuración
sudo tee /etc/yum.repos.d/inled.repo <<EOF
[inled]
name=Inled Repository
baseurl=https://apt.inled.es/rpm/
enabled=1
gpgcheck=1
repo_gpgcheck=1
gpgkey=https://apt.inled.es/archive.key
EOF

# Instalar paquetes
sudo dnf install &lt;paquete&gt;</code></pre>

            <h3>Arch Linux (Pacman)</h3>
            <pre><code># 1. Añadir al final de /etc/pacman.conf
[inled]
SigLevel = Required DatabaseOptional
Server = https://apt.inled.es/arch/

# 2. Descargar e importar la llave GPG
wget https://apt.inled.es/archive.key
sudo pacman-key --add archive.key
sudo pacman-key --lsign-key <KEY_ID>
rm archive.key

# 3. Actualizar e instalar
sudo pacman -Sy</code></pre>
        </section>

        <section class="card" style="text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0052cc 0%, #002e73 100%); color: white;">
            <h2 style="color: white; border-bottom-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);">🛠️ Zona Desarrolladores</h2>
            <p>Aprende a integrar este repositorio en tus procesos de CI/CD y desplegar apps automáticamente.</p>
            <a href="/skills/inled-repo-support.md" class="btn" style="background: white; color: var(--primary); margin-top: 10px;">Ver Skill para Gemini CLI</a>
        </section>

        <footer>
            &copy; 2026 Inled Group. Servido vía Cloudflare Pages.
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
